        "v": 5,
        "title": "gravityindex tool added to base2 agent and CLI",
        "summary": "Added `gravity_index` to `base2` agent tools and updated `GravityIndexParams` type. Base2 now mandates using this tool for third-party service discovery instead of relying on memory. CLI rendering refactored to display actions as bold 'Services · <Verb>' subcommands. Covers agents, CLI, and shared types.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "at": "2026-09-14T16:26:09.977Z"
      },
      "eli5": {
        "text": "The assistant now has a new tool to look up third-party services instead of guessing from memory, so when you ask about a database, payment provider, or other external service it will use this catalog to find the right recommendation. The text shown in the command line for these lookups has been simplified to read like a clear menu item, such as 'Services · search' or 'Services · browse.' This is live today for anyone using the assistant.",
