        "title": "CLI package bump to 0.0.102",
        "summary": "Version bumped to 0.0.102 in `freebuff/cli/release/package.json`. Covers CLI release artifact.",
        "significance": "minor",
        "at": "2026-09-14T16:25:48.222Z"
