        "text": "The team updated the internal checks that make sure the assistant's tools are described correctly. Specifically, they rewrote how the gravity index search feature's possible actions are listed, switching from a loose type definition to a stricter interface that now spells out a fixed set of allowed actions like search, browse, and report integration. This is a behind-the-scenes test suite update with no changes to the features themselves; users will not notice any difference in behavior today. The change ensures that only the intended gravity index actions are recognized going forward, preventing unexpected or unsupported operations.",
