        "title": "v0.0.103 adds noReview flag, inlines JSON refs, fixes pause error",
        "summary": "CLI v0.0.103 introduces `noReview` option in `createBase2` to disable free-tier code reviewer agent spawning. `openai-compatible-prepare-tools.ts` now inlines local `$ref` schemas via `inlineLocalSchemaRefs` to prevent upstream resolution failures. `sdk/src/run.ts` preserves `CodebuffRunPausedError` instead of catching it as tool failure. `common/src/env-schema.ts` adds optional `NEXT_PUBLIC_GRAVITY_PIXEL_ID`.",
